<section id="station-utilization">
  <h2>Station Utilization & Demand Analysis</h2>
  <p class="lead">Demand and load are almost identical operational signals in this dataset (correlation {corr.loc['charging_demand','station_load']:.3f}). The strongest utilization separation is by time slot, not by the two observed location types.</p>
  <div class="grid-2">
    <div class="chart-card">{charts['time_metrics']}</div>
    <div class="chart-card">{charts['top_demand']}</div>
  </div>
