    <div class="takeaway"><strong>Location split is balanced.</strong> Urban contributes {by_location.loc['Urban','Sessions']:,} sessions and Highway contributes {by_location.loc['Highway','Sessions']:,} sessions.</div>
    <div class="takeaway"><strong>Targeted station review.</strong> Highest demand segments include {html.escape(top_demand.iloc[0]['Station / Location'])} at {fmt(top_demand.iloc[0]['Avg_demand'],1)} average demand.</div>
